<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos sees 1997 net at 480 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cosmos sees 1997 net at 480 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmos Bottling Corp, the beverage unit of RFM Corp, said on Wednesday it expects a net income of 480 million pesos in 1997, up 55 percent from its 1996 net estimate of 310 million pesos.</p>
</text>
